{"ID":"20240205165628-zbb1w5k","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205165628-zbb1w5k","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165628-zbb1w5k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101848-3suifnc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607150840-5xshc3a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2622,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620080747-ua90jid\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:7,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:7\u0026#125;","title":"108女贞实（女贞子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240811100950"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206101848-3suifnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101848-3suifnc","updated":"20240206101856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产浙江，江苏、湖南、福建、广西、江西、四川等地。\n【性状】\t呈卵形、椭圆形或肾形，长68.5mm，直径3.55.5mm。表面黑紫色或灰黑色，皱缩不平，基部有果梗痕或具宿萼及短梗。体轻。外果皮薄，中果皮较松软，易剥离，内果皮木质，黄棕色，具纵棱，破开后种子通常为1粒，肾形，紫黑色，油性。无臭，味甘、微苦涩。\n【性味】\t甘、苦，凉。\n【功效】\t滋补肝肾，明目乌发。用于眩晕耳鸣，腰膝酸软，须发早白，目暗不明，内热消渴、骨蒸潮热。"}]},{"ID":"20240206101849-zatmnu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101849-zatmnu0","updated":"20240620171027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206101849-n3u32ty.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165908-h2b08j5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165908-h2b08j5","updated":"20240205165908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"女贞子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/女贞子-20240205165908-whagpv6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240221194705-1ypzckz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221194705-1ypzckz","updated":"20240221194758"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 418px;","style":"width: 408px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221194705-26ht7vo.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 408px;\" parent-style=\"width: 418px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221194758-gzjf1d3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240811094749-788c7w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240811094749-788c7w4","updated":"20240811095216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 407px;","style":"width: 397px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"女贞子 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/女贞子 11-20240811095216-needsw2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 397px;\" parent-style=\"width: 407px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 804px;","style":"width: 794px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"女贞子 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/女贞子 10-20240811095106-r9jmib6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeClosePa